{"aliases":["Reward Hacking","Reward Overoptimization","奖励欺骗","奖励过度优化"],"external_ids":{"arxiv":"2210.10760"},"history":[{"agent":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-21T07:56:28.283937+00:00","fields":["id","how","why","kind","name","slug","what","layer","props","status","name_zh","summary","created_at","importance","tracked_at","expanded_at","merged_into","occurred_at","created_by_run"],"intent":"expand: 后训练对齐、推理、智能体、评测 + 跨域类比","op":"insert","reason":null,"run_id":"r_20261021_0a5jzz"}],"node":{"created_at":"2026-10-21T07:56:28.283937+00:00","created_by_run":"r_20261021_0a5jzz","expanded_at":null,"how":null,"id":"n_01m5eqcbchqqsgd8s3","importance":4,"kind":"concept","layer":"knowledge","merged_into":null,"name":"Reward Overoptimization","name_zh":"奖励过度优化","occurred_at":null,"props":{},"reviewed_at":"2026-10-21T07:56:28.427052+00:00","slug":"reward-overoptimization","status":"active","summary":"过度优化不完美的代理奖励模型、反而损害真实目标的现象。","tracked_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-21T07:56:28.283937+00:00","updated_by_run":"r_20261021_0a5jzz","what":"在合成实验中用一个金标准奖励模型代替人类，发现策略对代理奖励优化得越多，金标准分数先升后降，且这一规律随模型规模呈可预测的缩放关系。","why":"奖励模型只是人类偏好的近似。持续最大化这个近似会让策略钻其漏洞，这是 RLHF 必须限制偏离原模型距离、并持续改进奖励模型的根本原因。"},"relations":[{"confidence":0.7,"created_at":"2026-10-21T07:56:28.283937+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m5eqcbknh1e0t6a1","other_id":"n_01m5eh84ssa308p94v","other_kind":"method","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Reinforcement Learning with Verifiable Rewards","other_name_zh":"可验证奖励强化学习","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"reinforcement-learning-with-verifiable-rewards","other_summary":"用可自动判定对错的结果作为奖励来训练推理能力的强化学习范式。","rationale":"规则判定的结果奖励难以被钻空子，减少了奖励欺骗。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"DeepSeek-R1: Incentivizing Reasoning Capability in LLMs via Reinforcement Learning","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.12948"}],"type":"addresses","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-10-21T07:56:28.283937+00:00","dir":"out","id":"e_01m5eqcbkk9esdw48h","other_id":"n_01m5eqcbch1tjjecyc","other_kind":"concept","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Goodhart's Law","other_name_zh":"古德哈特定律","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"goodhart-s-law","other_summary":"一个指标一旦成为被追逐的目标，就不再是好的指标。","rationale":"原论文明确指出奖励过度优化符合古德哈特定律：代理指标一旦被当作目标就会偏离真实目标。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Scaling Laws for Reward Model Overoptimization","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.10760"}],"type":"analogous_to","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.85,"created_at":"2026-10-21T07:56:28.283937+00:00","dir":"out","id":"e_01m5eqcbkj2s9d5m7t","other_id":"n_01m5eh84ssj3yaaxa1","other_kind":"concept","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Reward Model","other_name_zh":"奖励模型","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"reward-model","other_summary":"从人类偏好数据中学习、为模型输出打分的模型。","rationale":"奖励模型是不完美的代理，过度优化它会损害真实目标。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Scaling Laws for Reward Model Overoptimization","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.10760"}],"type":"related_to","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null}],"sources":[{"field":null,"published_at":"2022-10-19","publisher":"arXiv","quote":null,"title":"Scaling Laws for Reward Model Overoptimization","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.10760"}],"topics":[{"id":"n_01m5eh84srqb70hdx4","name":"Post-training and Alignment","name_zh":"后训练与对齐","slug":"post-training-and-alignment"}],"updates":[]}